      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since the 1990s, Tahoe Park has received street lights, a jogging trail, upgraded picnic areas, and fitness stations to enhance visitor experience.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
